<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Domain Expiring Soon</title>
</head>
<body>
    <div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px;">
        <h2>Domain Expiring Soon</h2>
        <p>The domain for your monitor <strong>{{.MonitorName}}</strong> ({{.MonitorURL}}) is expiring in <strong>{{.DaysRemaining}} days</strong>.</p>
        <p>Expiration Date: <strong>{{.ExpirationDate}}</strong></p>
        <p>Please take action to renew your domain name registration to avoid downtime.</p>
        <a href="{{.DashboardURL}}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; color: #fff; background-color: #d9534f; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;">View Monitor Details</a>
        <br>
        <br>
        <p>Thanks,<br>The Opsway Team</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
